# Data files
# Root datasets dir ONLY (anchored): in worktrees `datasets` is a SYMLINK
# to the main checkout, and an unanchored `datasets/` does not match symlinks.
# The viewer-level entry covers the same symlink some perf/probe setups
# place inside the package so a package-cwd HTTP server can reach it.
/datasets
/packages/luxar-viewer/datasets
debug-view.png
delme/
lightsheet_overview/
# Deprecated folders (no longer used)
develop-eggs/
dist/
# Distribution / packaging
doc_reviews/
docs/_build/
docs/_static/
docs/_templates/
# Documentation builds
# Anchored: an unanchored `downloads/` matches at ANY depth, which silently
# swallowed packages/luxar/src/luxar/demos/_support/downloads/. Git kept
# tracking those files, so nothing looked wrong — but hatchling honours
# .gitignore when selecting wheel contents, so the subpackage was dropped
# from every built wheel and `luxar --version` died on a clean install.
/downloads/
.DS_Store
*.egg
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
eggs/
.env
env/
ENV/
# Environment variables
.env.*.local
.env.local
error-state.png
/exports/
generated/
